hat section's lead-in from \"Skills should be structured for\nefficient use of context:\" to a sentence that names progressive\ndisclosure as a loading mechanism, so readers who follow the link land\non a definition rather than a bare set of structural guidelines. The\noriginal three-level list and `SKILL.md` line-count guidance are\npreserved unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e1648f8cc24b8f3d892e3477f872942f66f78c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentskills/agentskills/git/trees/1e1648f8cc24b8f3d892e3477f872942f66f78c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentskills/agentskills/git/commits/b8d2613ac050aa4aa8bfb2cf28380d81cdfcd1ca","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEh/+OGbyzfRKdx76XDaQK/SEENpEFAmnlNn4ACgkQDaQK/SEE\nNpFwtg//YZL+mLlaluQed3xMlmoVjPOk0nMQ3X7Xvf1u6gWcHTRGDBhDs3rGA4kL\ng7F4/D0fneXBDIOJ0eitoHj2Intub+TcXqrWgOwF5kP34k4JwPcfthjRnvSxE3Tn\nP+wOG5nquOgNQWKQLBdXaVJN+/1qQP+OD6kgxciRGC21ChPySmnAvaYqu/4L3fiy\nfcgrProEnxEMO6wTZMSPztp1pVgpLf0OThefTGJZ5Keyb9T5L3x7IPUIsTOhpHnw\no2vFZMXiSlTwYRdGkQd2J2gySzFhropfsyUxJpmYvnaIfL511I9WQ+rKY/0QAMDs\nmNzg5JXfiKMWy1IuztDZuXHAUXgIwSUL0hI4km5e8XrtF4FIFDmzu31OtKC68ayg\nb7vA4jUPzjfI799QM7Ska7cWqWhU0XvTI8vP77h+Yol7LH6x5NV8PCqWikjJX6B0\nCYPvFOGbLjp9LkYwF47DuFKkHvUiFJqjmIjn+9JSmKO/Ri0nM1Ns9GjW1eHXP24i\nH+tv31Rfnm+7lCqIbSUj4Fu3SXqlZIjSxNJQCKnknwZCbnZSJSjh/5q/rsM5Eo4N\nryKcPYmt5JBhlB3mTx/iC4W23SOXimr8rU2TZzfn1tEoPboP50a+5YXQKV1M0COv\nozSfEg5obkmdQv5C0xEswIDeLjc91FB7R7WHySf4bDNATly2Gvs=\n=yZ95\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 1e1648f8cc24b8f3d892e3477f872942f66f78c4\nparent 8aeff476971ff1d4eb87a49568678c3f71c38f68\nauthor Jonathan Hefner <jonathan@hefner.pro> 1776629304 -0500\ncommitter Jonathan Hefner <jonathan@hefner.pro> 1776629367 -0500\n\nPoint \"progressive disclosure\" links at `specification.mdx`\n\nTwo links in `best-practices.mdx` and `optimizing-descriptions.mdx`\npointed at `/what-are-skills#how-skills-work`, blocking the eventual\nremoval of `what-are-skills.mdx`. Redirect them to the existing\n`## Progressive disclosure` section in `specification.mdx`, which is a\nmore natural reference target for the concept.\n\nAlso expand that section's lead-in from \"Skills should be structured for\nefficient use of context:\" to a sentence that names progressive\ndisclosure as a loading mechanism, so readers who follow the link land\non a definition rather than a bare set of structural guidelines. The\noriginal three-level list and `SKILL.md` line-count guidance are\npreserved unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-04-19T20:29:18Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentskills/agentskills/commits/b8d2613ac050aa4aa8bfb2cf28380d81cdfcd1ca","html_url":"https://github.com/agentskills/agentskills/commit/b8d2613ac050aa4aa8bfb2cf28380d81cdfcd1ca","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentskills/agentskills/commits/b8d2613ac050aa4aa8bfb2cf28380d81cdfcd1ca/comments","author":{"login":"jonathanhefner","id":771968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/771968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner","html_url":"https://github.com/jonathanhefner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonathanhefner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.